<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ brand }}｜在地商家一頁式網站作品集</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ brand }} 為在地商家製作的一頁式網站範例：咖啡廳、美髮、寵物美容、診所等。NT${{ price_twd }} 一次付清，{{ hosting_years }} 年主機免費。">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@600&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:"Noto Sans TC",system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0f1117;color:#e7e9ee;line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.wrap{width:min(1100px,100% - 40px);margin-inline:auto;padding:72px 0}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.2rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.2}
.sub{color:#9aa3b2;margin:12px 0 8px;font-size:1.1rem;max-width:60ch}
.price{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:#1b1f2a;border:1px solid #2a3040;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;margin-top:14px}
.price b{color:#fde047}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:44px}
.card{background:#171a23;border:1px solid #262b38;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#3b4254}
.thumb{height:130px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92)}
.body{padding:18px 20px 20px}
.body h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800}
.body p{color:#9aa3b2;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:4px}
.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:.75rem;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#232838;color:#c7cdd9;font-weight:600}
.tag.live{background:#163a27;color:#7ee2a8}
footer{color:#6b7280;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:60px;border-top:1px solid #262b38;padding-top:24px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>{{ brand }} 作品集</h1>
  <p class="sub">我們幫還沒有官網的在地店家，做一個手機看起來漂亮、客人 30 秒就能找到你、打給你的一頁式網站。</p>
  <span class="price">一次 <b>NT${{ price_twd }}</b>・不收月費・含 {{ hosting_years }} 年主機</span>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for s in sites %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ s.slug }}/">
      <div class="thumb" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,{{ s.p }},{{ s.pd }})">{{ s.word }}</div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.category }}・{{ s.city }}{{ s.district }}</p>
        <span class="tag {% if s.live %}live{% endif %}">{% if s.live %}已上線{% else %}示範草稿{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <footer>© {{ year }} {{ brand }}{% if contact %}・{{ contact }}{% endif %}</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
